    | Phase | Pass Rate | Description |
    |-------|-----------|-------------|
    | Original Baseline | #{@phase_comparison[:original_baseline][:pass_rate]}% | #{@phase_comparison[:original_baseline][:description]} |
    | Post-Priority-2 | #{@phase_comparison[:post_priority_2][:pass_rate]}% | #{@phase_comparison[:post_priority_2][:description]} |
    | **Post-Phase-3** | **#{@phase_comparison[:post_phase_3][:pass_rate]}%** | **#{@phase_comparison[:post_phase_3][:description]}** |
    
