    - **Improvement from Original:** +#{(@phase_comparison[:post_phase_3][:pass_rate] - @phase_comparison[:original_baseline][:pass_rate]).round(2)}%
    - **Improvement from Priority-2:** +#{(@phase_comparison[:post_phase_3][:pass_rate] - @phase_comparison[:post_priority_2][:pass_rate]).round(2)}%
    
